@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

title Render plugin in NINA imaging page

actor User
participant "NINA Imaging Page" as Imaging
participant "RaTrendDockableView.xaml" as View
participant "RaTrendDockableVM" as VM
participant "WPF Binding Engine" as Binding
participant "StatusClient" as Status

User -> Imaging: Open Imaging tab
Imaging -> View: Load resource dictionary/view
View -> VM: Bind DataContext

Binding -> VM: Read initial properties
VM --> Binding: ConnectionStatusText, StateText,
VM --> Binding: RaErrorPlotPoints, axis labels
Binding -> View: Paint initial UI

Status -> VM: ConnectionStateChanged(connected?)
VM -> VM: ApplyConnectionState()
VM --> Binding: PropertyChanged(ConnectionStatusText, IsConnected)
Binding -> View: Update indicator

Status -> VM: SnapshotReceived(snapshot)
VM -> VM: ApplySnapshot(snapshot)
VM -> VM: RefreshRaErrorPlot()
VM --> Binding: PropertyChanged(plot + text fields)
Binding -> View: Re-render chart and status badges
@enduml
